"content": "<h1>拿順（Naashon）</h1><p>有英文譯本在<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02006023\" data-end-ref=\"02006023\">出埃及記六章23節</data>將亞米拿達的兒子拿順（Nahshon）拼寫為Naashon。</p><p><em>見</em> <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"6460\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">拿順（Nahshon）</data>。</p>",
